WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.341
KINGO
The only thing standing in the way

00:00:02.391 --> 00:00:05.825
of the end of the world is me.
And my sidekicks.

00:00:05.875 --> 00:00:06.680
SPRITE
Are you serious?

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:09.344
KINGO
Ok fine, it's kind of a team effort.

00:00:09.699 --> 00:00:11.470
(Marvel's newest heroes
have arrived.)

00:00:13.428 --> 00:00:14.221
KINGO
Ikaris.

00:00:14.271 --> 00:00:16.353
IKARIS
I can shoot energy beams from my eyes.

00:00:16.404 --> 00:00:17.089
KINGO
Sersi.

00:00:17.139 --> 00:00:18.573
SERSI
I can manipulate matter.

00:00:18.623 --> 00:00:20.081
KINGO
Ajak, our leader.

00:00:20.131 --> 00:00:22.510
And Thena.
Deadly, fashionable.

00:00:22.560 --> 00:00:23.541
THENA
Hello.

00:00:23.592 --> 00:00:24.550
PHASTOS
So that's everybody?

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:26.294
KINGO
I guess I'll have a little bit of help.

00:00:26.344 --> 00:00:27.344
[Laughing]

